@format 1
@id functionality.media-loading.funnel
@title Media loading — Funnel only
@section Functionality
@area Media loading — Funnel only
@entry funnel-path-change, funnel-drain
@summary Show only Funnel-specific selected-path loading and post-relay source draining.
@related functionality.media-loading.common.list-selection, functionality.media-loading.common.viewer
@tag media
@tag loading
@tag funnel

@alias funnel = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.PFunnelTab
@alias messenger = Cadroue.ShellEngine.LMessenger
@alias app = Cadroue.UIShell.PProgram

[funnel-path-change] Funnel Files current-path event <input>
= Shared Files logic published the current path through PListPathChange.
> funnel-path-result

[funnel-path-result] Funnel selected-path adapter <decision>
- Ignore a blank path; otherwise request it from the Funnel viewer @ funnel.PFunnelPathShow(...)
? "Nonblank current path" > map:functionality.media-loading.common.viewer
? "Blank current path" > funnel-no-request

[funnel-no-request] Funnel viewer request omitted <output>
= Funnel does not call the shared viewer-loading pipeline.

[funnel-drain] Funnel source drain after relay <input>
- After Funnel relay handling determines which source paths were relayed, invoke the configured Funnel drain seam @ messenger.LMessengerFunnelDescribe(...)
- Remove those paths from the selected tab's Files docket through the UI seam configured at startup @ app.OnStartup(...)
> funnel-drain-result

[funnel-drain-result] Funnel drain consequence <output>
= If draining removes the current file while another file remains, the shared Files-selection/removal logic can publish a replacement path.
